en-US.releaseNotes:
Release Notes for v44.11.0
Features
- Added Menu.setHighlightColors() to set menu highlight colors on Windows. #55500 ^{(Also in 45, 46)}
Fixes
- Fixed a main process crash when a setPermissionRequestHandler callback answered a pointer or keyboard lock request after its <webview> was destroyed. #55677
- Fixed a possible hang on quit on macOS when using systemPreferences.subscribeLocalNotification, subscribeNotification, or subscribeWorkspaceNotification. #55681 ^{(Also in 45, 46)}
- Fixed renderer crashes caused by unbounded webRequest redirect loops. #55655 ^{(Also in 43, 45, 46)}
- Fixed setIgnoreMouseEvents(true, { forward: true }) not tracking legacy windows when they are reparented. #55621 ^{(Also in 45, 46)}
- Fixed unhandled rejection and hang in net.fetch on upload stream error. #55690 ^{(Also in 45, 46)}
Other Changes
- Backported fixes from upstream ANGLE, Chromium, Dawn, devtools_frontend, FFmpeg, PDFium, Skia and V8. #55585
